      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability: split into focused test methods per scenario, remove unused imports and the unused `WHITESPACE` field.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version splits the single monolithic test method into five focused test methods (null input, empty input, normal wrapping, long word at end, long word in middle, and multiple spaces), removes all unused imports and the unused `WHITESPACE` field, and introduces a `NL` constant to reduce repetition — all while preserving the exact same method calls, arguments, and expected outcomes."
